WEBVTT

00:01:29.925 --> 00:01:32.538
even into the blood and vital organs.

00:01:32.538 --> 00:01:35.014
To avoid this sometimes dangerous fate,

00:01:35.014 --> 00:01:38.239
your immune system must launch
a stronger attack,

00:01:38.239 --> 00:01:41.293
coordinating its activity with the brain.

00:01:41.293 --> 00:01:43.714
That's where those unpleasant symptoms
come in,

00:01:43.714 --> 00:01:45.765
starting with the surging temperature,

00:01:45.765 --> 00:01:46.829
aches and pains,

00:01:46.829 --> 00:01:48.307
and sleepiness.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:51.172
So why do we experience this?

00:01:51.172 --> 00:01:53.524
When the immune system is under
serious attack,

00:01:53.524 --> 00:01:55.908
it secretes more cytokines,

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:57.999
which trigger two responses.

00:01:57.999 --> 00:02:02.019
First, the vagus nerve, which runs through
the body into the brain,